OL,3,GNEWSARapist who attacked women while
OL,4,Aasleep or in pain is jailed for 10
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FJudge Lord Harrower said Scott
OL,8,F"consistently" prioritised his own
OL,9,Fsexual gratification over any concern
OL,10,Ffor the wellbeing of the women.
